      "PackedChunks::put_marked_catalog_object for background catalog runs",
      "PackedChunks::put_prepared_catalog_run for merged file-backed runs"
    ],
    "cancellation": "An owned WritePins scope retains both protections until both ordered blocking operations settle, even after caller cancellation.",
    "remote": "Retains marker-before-object ordering and the existing object-store publication path.",
    "durability": "No file or directory durability barriers were removed.",
    "scope": "This reduces admissions for the paired call sites; it does not halve all repository pin operations."
  },
